<title>USA: TABLE - Lone Star Tech Q2 earnings rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Lone Star Tech Q2 earnings rise.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>LONE STAR TECHNOLOGIES INC.</p>
<p>			CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF EARNINGS</p>
<p>	     (Unaudited; in millions, except share data)</p>
<p>						Q2	     Six Months</p>
<p>					1997     1996     1997     1996</p>
<p>Net revenues		    $172.3   $141.9   $331.5   $254.4</p>
<p>Gross earnings		   16.3     13.2     30.6     20.5</p>
<p>Operating earnings	     11.7	9.0     21.0     12.8</p>
<p>Net earnings		     10.3	7.1     18.1	9.7</p>
<p>Eearnings per share:	   0.48     0.34     0.85     0.47</p>
<p>NOTE: Analysts' consensus forecast was $0.42 per share, according to First Call.</p>
</text>
